1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,812
A new office building has covered its roof with grass and wild flowers.

2
00:00:04,762 --> 00:00:08,087
Green roofs help keep buildings cool in summer.

3
00:00:08,087 --> 00:00:11,687
They also absorb rainwater and reduce flooding.

4
00:00:11,687 --> 00:00:15,737
The city plans to support fifty such projects this year.

